  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture dest.ml gives mime_type -> Destination.path:type (suffix match) and other -> config:type (plain top-level type called as config x). ocaml.py:334 still registers type/module symbols in symbol_by_name; the lookup at ~L507 does not filter by kind. Scope is wider than '1 case left': any call whose name matches a type binds to it. MECHANISM: type/module symbols registered in symbol_by_name and resolver.lookup has no kind filter, so a call binds a non-callable. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-nupak,WI-surid,WI-jalal."  # 6c1c
